.TH DIALOG_UPDATE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
dialog_update \- Advance the typewriter by dt and handle dismissal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdialog.h\(dq
.BI "void dialog_update(Dialog *d, const Input *in, float dt);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Advance the typewriter by dt and handle dismissal. SPACE, ENTER, a left click, or PAD_SOUTH pressed this frame first completes the line (if still typing) and then, on the next press, closes it. Call from the owning scene's handle_input with e\->dt, or from update with &e\->input, but from only one of them. Does nothing when inactive.
.SH MODULE
dialog (src/engine/dialog/dialog.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dialog_show (3),
.BR dialog_done (3),
.BR key_pressed (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
